{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/ckzh00U6hRO24bgDwMyzOw","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:05.080920+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/ckzh00U6hRO24bgDwMyzOw","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/bxIar8cfkW24KLia8D8NyJ7zX833lz3NSJtXXdLotgMkwPewxMWxQPl541VH1f2xd2PPUibFY60CB3dS9Vm7ELhQgmAWIB7Gpmqr2vsDgACx8/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/bQv07rEoSgnASDXC53WkoCVAbC73AzGr2gJ1hkgmLJf47DcQBvKhS65n8gFR9Rfr2aeIbyMIbxguySA37OaCNA/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>一、</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>报名条件</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/cXNib8XM7AeThlzRD6t4puicdTNrNlUlHrJmL8GAVrexgasTpow8AicTKKN4gGFVe3LaXFibHGcr6Uw8aGXMcOqZaW0iao0MzhIaaqHMhEr1A6Uc/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>（一）基本条件</span></span></strong><strong></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/cXNib8XM7AeThlzRD6t4puicdTNrNlUlHrJmL8GAVrexgasTpow8AicTKKN4gGFVe3LaXFibHGcr6Uw8aGXMcOqZaW0iao0MzhIaaqHMhEr1A6Uc/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>1、拥护中国共产党的领导，热爱祖国，品德良好，遵纪守法；</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>2、报名考生必须获得本科所在学校的推免资格；</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>3、2027年应届本科毕业生。</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/cXNib8XM7AeThlzRD6t4puicdTNrNlUlHrJmL8GAVrexgasTpow8AicTKKN4gGFVe3LaXFibHGcr6Uw8aGXMcOqZaW0iao0MzhIaaqHMhEr1A6Uc/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>（二）汉语言文化学院2027年接收推免生专业、外语条件 </span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/cXNib8XM7AeThlzRD6t4puicdTNrNlUlHrJmL8GAVrexgasTpow8AicTKKN4gGFVe3LaXFibHGcr6Uw8aGXMcOqZaW0iao0MzhIaaqHMhEr1A6Uc/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><table><tbody><tr><td><section><p><span>专业名称</span></p></section></td><td><section><p><span>研究方向码</span></p></section></td><td><section><p><span>研究方向名称</span></p></section></td><td><section><p><span>可接收本科所属学科专业代码及名称</span></p></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><p><strong><span>国际中文教育（专业型）</span></strong></p></section></td><td><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></td><td><section><p><strong><span>作为第二语言的汉语教学与研究</span></strong></p></section></td><td><section><p><strong><span>05</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>文学</span></strong></p></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><p><strong><span>国际中文教育（专业型）</span></strong></p></section></td><td><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></td><td><section><p><strong><span>第二语言</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>习得研究</span></strong></p></section></td><td><section><p><strong><span>05</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>文学</span></strong></p></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><p><strong><span>国际中文教育（专业型）</span></strong></p></section></td><td><section><p><strong><span>03</span></strong></p></section></td><td><section><p><strong><span>汉语言</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>交际与文化</span></strong></p></section></td><td><section><p><strong><span>05</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>文学</span></strong></p></section></td></tr></tbody></table></section></section><section><section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>本院对推免生外语水平的要求为</span></strong><strong><span>：</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>1、</span><span><span>外语语种为英语的考生，须符合以下</span></span><span>任一项</span><span><span>：</span></span></strong></p><p><span>（1）通过全国大学英语六级考试,成绩425分或更高；</span></p><p><span>（2）TOEFL成绩90分（120分制）及以上或4.5分（6分制）及以上；</span></p><p><span>（3）IELTS（A类/学术类）成绩6分及以上；</span></p><p><span>（4）GRE成绩在310以上，GMAT成绩在640以上；</span></p><p><span>（5）英语专业四级（及以上）考试合格。</span></p><p><strong><span><br/></span></strong></p><p><strong><span>2、</span></strong><strong><span>第一外语不是英语的推免生，如果招生目录中允许其他语种报考，对应语种应达到以下标准：</span></strong></p><p><span>（1）日语要求日本语能力测试N1合格或日语专业四级合格；</span></p><p><span>（2）俄语要求俄语专业四级合格；</span></p><p><span>（3）法语要求法语专业四级考试合格或法语DEFL/DALF考试达到C1级；</span></p><p><span>（4）德语要求德语专业四级考试合格或德福考试成绩19～20分，或TELC以及歌德德语水平测试达到C1级；</span></p><p><span>（5）西班牙语要求专业四级考试合格或达到西班牙语DELE考试C1级；</span></p><p><span>（6）希腊语要求希腊语考试合格，达到C1标准，或希腊语国家考试通过，达到C1标准。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>二、</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>申请流程及方式</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/cXNib8XM7AeThlzRD6t4puicdTNrNlUlHrJmL8GAVrexgasTpow8AicTKKN4gGFVe3LaXFibHGcr6Uw8aGXMcOqZaW0iao0MzhIaaqHMhEr1A6Uc/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>（一）网上报名</span></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/cXNib8XM7AeThlzRD6t4puicdTNrNlUlHrJmL8GAVrexgasTpow8AicTKKN4gGFVe3LaXFibHGcr6Uw8aGXMcOqZaW0iao0MzhIaaqHMhEr1A6Uc/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>在“南开大学研究生报名系统</span><span><span>（报名网址https://yzxt.nankai.edu.cn/intern/frontend/web/）”</span></span><span><span>中选择“汉语言文化学院”完成信息填报并进行申请，报名系统现已开通。</span></span></p><p><strong><span>报名截止时间</span></strong><span>：</span><span><strong><span>9月9日24:00</span></strong></span><span>。</span></p><p><span>信息填写完毕后，请务必点击“提交”，否则将无法进行资格审核。另外请认真填报，不要重复报名。及时自行查询“学生状态”，注册用户名请勿使用中文。</span></p><p><strong><span>需注意</span></strong><span>：南开大学接收推免生网上报名系统不能替代教育部推免服务系统，通过南开大学接收推免生网上报名系统报名的学生还需要在教育部推免服务系统中履行报名程序。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/cXNib8XM7AeThlzRD6t4puicdTNrNlUlHrJmL8GAVrexgasTpow8AicTKKN4gGFVe3LaXFibHGcr6Uw8aGXMcOqZaW0iao0MzhIaaqHMhEr1A6Uc/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>（二）学院审核</span></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/cXNib8XM7AeThlzRD6t4puicdTNrNlUlHrJmL8GAVrexgasTpow8AicTKKN4gGFVe3LaXFibHGcr6Uw8aGXMcOqZaW0iao0MzhIaaqHMhEr1A6Uc/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>1、学院将对网申学生进行审核，通过者将接到邮件或电话通知，未通过者不再专门通知。请同学们报名时务必准确填写电子邮箱和手机号码，并及时查看、回复邮箱。</span></p><p><span>2、目前请同学们网上报名即可，不需上传、寄送证明材料。</span></p><p><span>3、待学院完成全部审核工作后，会发布面试考核工作安排，请留意汉语言文化学院官网。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/cXNib8XM7AeThlzRD6t4puicdTNrNlUlHrJmL8GAVrexgasTpow8AicTKKN4gGFVe3LaXFibHGcr6Uw8aGXMcOqZaW0iao0MzhIaaqHMhEr1A6Uc/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>（三）面试工作</span></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/cXNib8XM7AeThlzRD6t4puicdTNrNlUlHrJmL8GAVrexgasTpow8AicTKKN4gGFVe3LaXFibHGcr6Uw8aGXMcOqZaW0iao0MzhIaaqHMhEr1A6Uc/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>1、汉语言文化学院接收推免生面试统一为到校线下面试，预计时间为</span><strong><span>9月中旬</span></strong><span>，请考生提前做好准备。</span></p><p><span>2、现场材料审查:面试当天将现场审查考生的身份证、学生证、外语成绩证明等信息原件，审核是否为本人、是否达到外语要求等信息。核对后返还原件。</span></p><p><span>3、现场需提交以下纸质证明材料：</span></p><p><span>（1）南开大学推免招生系统导出的信息表（须本人签字，报名号为00000000不影响提交）；</span></p><p><span>（2）身份证复印件、学生证复印件；</span></p><p><span>（3）获得推免资格的相关证明材料，需有学院教务部门的盖章；</span></p><p><span>（4）本科成绩单及专业排名（前6个学期），需注明专业总人数且有学院教务部门盖章；</span></p><p><span>（5）外语成绩证明；</span></p><p><span>（6）其他科研成果证明（如：发表论文或专业竞赛获奖证书）等。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>三、</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>其他说明</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>1、学生须承诺所有申报材料和信息均属实，如有弄虚作假，一经查实，取消本人资格。</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>2、南开大学汉语言文化学院将为推免研究生提供推免生奖学金、助学金等。</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>3、面试通知将在学院官网公布，请考生随时关注。以上内容如有变化，请以最新信息为准。</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>四、</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>电话：022-23503615  022-23501025</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>END</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>编辑丨李思彤</span></p><p><span>审核丨王红厂 王帅</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bxIar8cfkW28vtsaWFsRhrOXvcI8XVELSn4GoBFg9JQe3Te4a1pZcG0T8qU42uyh5pDSYvej2xF9CEicCVMn1InZu1cecVIEGY5bFtYMS78Y/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"d2f5f29cfd4e8b7acdc34a52f087fce6182c7e81a649232636e713dbc1bc4e69","textLength":1545,"sourceSha256":"b677e77c51c2c7676322fca3259b0efddc9c62b3f4229747bcfa1e4e2d4ffa4a","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-76e74df4e835bdbba531","title":"2026年南开大学汉语言文化学院关于2027年推荐免试硕士研究生预报名的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:05.080920+00:00"}
